OL,3,GNEWSAJLR suppliers call for shift to
OL,4,Aaerospace
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor Jaguar Land Rover suppliers have
OL,7,Furged the government to help automotive
OL,8,Fmanufacturers move into aerospace and
OL,9,Fdefence, warning that large-scale car
OL,10,Fproduction in the UK faces long-term
OL,11,Fdecline.
OL,13,FIn an open letter to the prime
OL,14,Fminister, chancellor and West Midlands
OL,15,FMayor Richard Parker, industry leaders
OL,16,Fargued Britain's automotive supply
OL,17,Fchain was "not in decline" but "in the
OL,18,Fwrong market".
OL,20,FThe intervention comes nearly a
OL,21,Ffortnight after JLR announced plans to
OL,22,Fcut 4,000 jobs.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
